  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Fitness Features**\n\nI\'m focusing on the core of this fitness app: gamified tracking. I\'m prioritizing customizable and pre-built workout routines. These will cover various styles like strength, HIIT, cardio, calisthenics, and mobility, ensuring a broad appeal.\n\n\n**Integrating Active Tracking**\n\nI\'ve integrated a real-time active workout tracker. It will handle sets, reps, weights, rest timers with audio and vibration, RPE, and form guidance. Also, I\'ll be tracking heart rate and calories, keeping these stats active.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Streams**\n\nI\'m now integrating Web Bluetooth for live biometric data from wearables. I\'m building a device sync manager to handle real-time metrics, battery, and connection status. My focus is expanding data streams to provide comprehensive fitness analysis.\n\n\n"
