  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining CSS Enhancements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing `src/index.css`, considering `font-outfit` and `font-sans` font families. I\'m also planning accessible focus-visible styles, custom scrollbars, and high-contrast color utilities. My next step is structuring the components and models required for the architecture.\n\n\n**Modeling Workout Data**\n\nI\'ve been creating data models for user profiles, workout routines, exercises, and workout sessions. I\'m fleshing out details like exercise sets with target and actual reps, weight, and RPE. I\'m also considering smartwatch device integration. I have created types for data like `WorkoutRoutine`, `ExerciseSet`, `WorkoutSession` and `Exercise`.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Models**\n\nI\'ve been further refining my data models. I\'m adding models for social and gamification features. New additions include `CommunityChallenge`, `LeaderboardEntry`, `Achievement`, `SocialLiveDuel`, and `NotificationReminder`. I\'m focusing on attributes like challenge goals, leaderboard ranking, achievement tiers, and live duel status. I\'m considering their relationships within the broader system.\n\n\n**Implementing Settings Components**\n\nI\'m working on the settings-related components now. I am working through the data models needed for settings like cloud sync status and user language preferences. I\'m currently defining `CloudSyncStatus` and `Language` types. I also plan for internationalization and translation data, and I\'m developing rich dictionaries. My goal is for complete language support covering all features of the application.\n\n\n**Designing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now focusing on UI components! I\'m creating the look of various features, like a language switcher, XP progress bar and level badge. Cloud sync, smartwatch and notification indicators are next on the list. I\'m also considering dashboards, workout catalogs, active workout modes, and a leaderboard view to improve the design.\n\n\n**Developing Feature Screens**\n\nNow I\'m designing specific feature screens. I\'m focusing on the functionality of the \"Join Challenge\" button and contributor feed, as well as enabling users to claim rewards. I have started working on specific components, such as `AchievementsView`, `AnalyticsView`, and `LiveSocialDuelModal`. Next is Smartwatch integration and push notification settings. I\'m also planning modals for each.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 610947782
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
