  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the development of **FitQuest Pro**, an advanced gamified fitness tracking platform built with React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n\n- **Gamified Progression & RPG Attributes**: Level progression with XP calculation, streak multiplier shields, promotion leagues (Bronze to Titan), and character attribute gauges (Strength, Endurance, Agility, Discipline).\n- **Active Workout Tracker**: Real-time set logging with weight/rep adjustment, automated 1RM estimation via Epley/Brzycki formulas, interactive rest timer with Web Audio acoustic cues, PR detection, and workout rating summaries.\n- **Detailed Analytics & Recharts Data Visualization**: Volume progression charts, calorie burn vs. heart rate correlation, estimated 1RM curves, and muscle group split radar diagrams.\n- **Weekly Community Challenges**: Global and weekly challenge tracker with target progression bars, personal contribution logging, top contributor ranking, and claimable XP rewards.\n- **Social Live Duel Mode**: Real-time virtual training arena with live competitor pace simulation, tap/keyboard spacebar rep counting, floating animated emoji reactions, and victory fanfares.\n- **Smartwatch & Biometrics Telemetry**: Live heart rate monitoring with active zone visualization (Rest, Warm-up, Fat Burn, Cardio, Peak), HRV metrics, estimated VO2 Max, and Bluetooth device simulation.\n- **Unlockable Achievements & Social Share**: Tiered badges (Bronze to Titan) with category filters, claimable bounties, and customizable social share card generator.\n- **Multi-Device Cloud Sync & Push Notifications**: Offline-first storage with simulated multi-device sync, JSON data import/export, and configurable daily push notification reminders.\n- **Accessibility & Multi-Language Support**: Full compliance with WCAG standards, high-contrast visual toggle, text size scaling, and internationalization (Spanish, English, Portuguese, French, German)."
    modified_response: "I have completed the development of **FitQuest Pro**, an advanced gamified fitness tracking platform built with React, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS.\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n\n- **Gamified Progression & RPG Attributes**: Level progression with XP calculation, streak multiplier shields, promotion leagues (Bronze to Titan), and character attribute gauges (Strength, Endurance, Agility, Discipline).\n- **Active Workout Tracker**: Real-time set logging with weight/rep adjustment, automated 1RM estimation via Epley/Brzycki formulas, interactive rest timer with Web Audio acoustic cues, PR detection, and workout rating summaries.\n- **Detailed Analytics & Recharts Data Visualization**: Volume progression charts, calorie burn vs. heart rate correlation, estimated 1RM curves, and muscle group split radar diagrams.\n- **Weekly Community Challenges**: Global and weekly challenge tracker with target progression bars, personal contribution logging, top contributor ranking, and claimable XP rewards.\n- **Social Live Duel Mode**: Real-time virtual training arena with live competitor pace simulation, tap/keyboard spacebar rep counting, floating animated emoji reactions, and victory fanfares.\n- **Smartwatch & Biometrics Telemetry**: Live heart rate monitoring with active zone visualization (Rest, Warm-up, Fat Burn, Cardio, Peak), HRV metrics, estimated VO2 Max, and Bluetooth device simulation.\n- **Unlockable Achievements & Social Share**: Tiered badges (Bronze to Titan) with category filters, claimable bounties, and customizable social share card generator.\n- **Multi-Device Cloud Sync & Push Notifications**: Offline-first storage with simulated multi-device sync, JSON data import/export, and configurable daily push notification reminders.\n- **Accessibility & Multi-Language Support**: Full compliance with WCAG standards, high-contrast visual toggle, text size scaling, and internationalization (Spanish, English, Portuguese, French, German)."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
