    thinking: "**Analyzing User Behavior**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on the initial user experience when they launch the app without being logged in. The immediate goal is the Login/Sign Up screen. I\'m considering the user\'s expectation of that prompt, and thinking through different flows.\n\n\n**Designing Authentication Portal**\n\nI\'ve transitioned from the initial login experience to crafting a dedicated Authentication & Onboarding View. My current focus is ensuring it appears seamlessly when a user isn\'t authenticated. The design includes clear options for registration (name, email, password), login (email and password), and a one-click Google sign-in. A \"Continue as Guest\" option is also available. Once logged in, the user begins with a fresh profile, complete with the Firebase Cloud connection status displayed. I\'m also planning easy account switching and logout functionality in the Navbar and Settings.\n\n\n"
